From: taynotfound <marztayron@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rain-1003: sound through the ADSP's APR/Elite services

rain's ADSP firmware has no GPR/AudioReach (adsp_apps), only apr_audio_svc.
TopazAudio now also speaks APR: core state, AFE core votes and TX core
clocks instead of PRM, AFE port RX_CODEC_DMA_RX_1, one ADM COPP, one ASM
PCM stream fed with 20 ms buffers from the ring iOS writes into. Codec,
SoundWire and the AW87390 amp are unchanged. adsp_tone=N plays a tone
through the same path. The stand-in /dev/redwood-audio stays only
without adsp=1. Untested on the phone.
---
